    <string name="range_info">Why these ranges?</string>
    <string name="range_info_text" formatted="false">Lithium batteries age slowest in the middle of the charge range. A high charge level strains the battery more than a low one, so the gentle presets stop charging earlier.\n\n20–80 %: balanced\n25–70 %: gentle\n30–60 %: very gentle\n\nThe narrower the range, the less of the battery you use each day. Pick the range that fits your day.</string>
